      "voiceover": {
        "captionText": "Welcome \u2014 this is about Public Disclosure of Astellas CCI: what's already public, and what it means for you. Here is the starting point: packages can contain company secrets and/or participant and personnel PI/PPD. So how do you know what's confidential? You classify with GUIDE-AST-6011, and you document on FORM-AST-35734 \u2014 the asset-specific library. And here is something worth pausing on: already public is not confidential. Check the public domain \u2014 if it's already out there, it is not CCI.",
        "voiceRef": "voice_ast_narrator",
        "locale": "en"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guide_classify",
      "title": "Classify with the GUIDE",
      "kind": "scene",
      "role": "topic",
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "Heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Classify with the GUIDE",
            "kicker": "GUIDE"
          },
          "meta": {
            "scene_id": "guide_classify",
            "role": "topic"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "GUIDE-AST-6011 v2.0 (April 2026; supersedes v1.0) \u2014 CCI / may-be-CCI / not-CCI including phase.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 0,
              "head": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Phase-decay: preclinical through Ph4, decreases later/after MA.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_phase_decay",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_phase_decay",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 1,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "CMC.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_cmc",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_cmc",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 1,
              "head": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "MAY-BE: DS names/structure early; quantitative composition; metabolite formulae/pathways that reveal manufacture; polymorphism/sequence; impurities; DS/DP manufacturing methods, sites, CMOs, specs, batch size, unpublished in-house cells; DP packaging technical specs; AAV fact of synthesis/formulation change.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_cmc_maybe",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_cmc_maybe",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Not-CCI: published/commercial cell-line names; general characterization; excipient names; standard storage; batch numbers; common techniques; fact of process change except AAV.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_cmc_not",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_cmc_not",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Nonclinical.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_nonclinical",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_nonclinical",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 1,
              "head": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "MAY-BE: unpublished novel MoA/concepts; metabolites until NDA/BLA; special substrate; exclusive assays; early results; CRO/site names; future plans; study dates; detailed HA advice; contractual strategy.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_nonclinical_maybe",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_nonclinical_maybe",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Not-CCI: ELISA/Biacore/common assays; published techniques; country names.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_nonclinical_not",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_nonclinical_not",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Clinical.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_clinical",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_clinical",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 1,
              "head": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "MAY-BE: unpublished patentable unit/daily/max dose (typ. Ph1); novel unqualified biomarkers; exclusive assays; non-label endpoints; third-party questionnaires when contract forbids disclosure.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_clinical_maybe",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_clinical_maybe",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Not-CCI: route/frequency/setting; design; results; CRO names; fact of HA consult.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_clinical_not",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_clinical_not",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Other.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_other",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_other",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 1,
              "head": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "MAY-BE: exposure calc, exposure/sales by country, projected exposure, product cost, net pricing.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_other_maybe",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_other_maybe",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Body",
          "props": {
            "text": "Not-CCI: list pricing.",
            "kicker": ""
          },
          "meta": {
            "element_id": "ele_guide_ast6011_other_not",
            "composed_from": "atom_guide_ast6011_other_not",
            "text_primitive": "tp_body",
            "style_ref": "brand.instructional",
            "structure": {
              "group": "atom_guide_ast6011",
              "depth": 2,
              "head": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "voiceover": {
        "captionText": "So how do you classify? GUIDE-AST-6011 is your tool \u2014 CCI, may-be-CCI, or not-CCI, including phase. And phase matters: standards apply at all phases, but the sensitivity decreases later and after marketing authorization. Here is how the GUIDE breaks it down. CMC: may-be-CCI includes drug-substance names and structure early, quantitative composition, metabolite formulae and pathways that reveal manufacture, polymorphism and sequence, impurities, manufacturing methods, sites, CMOs, specs, batch size, unpublished in-house cells, drug-product packaging technical specs, and AAV fact of synthesis or formulation change. Not-CCI: published or commercial cell-line names, general characterization, excipient names, standard storage, batch numbers, common techniques, and fact of process change except AAV. Nonclinical: may-be-CCI includes unpublished novel mechanism-of-action concepts, metabolites until NDA/BLA, special substrate, exclusive assays, early results, CRO and site names, future plans, study dates, detailed HA advice, and contractual strategy. Not-CCI: ELISA, Biacore, and common assays, published techniques, and country names. Clinical: may-be-CCI includes unpublished patentable unit, daily, or maximum dose \u2014 novel unqualified biomarkers, exclusive assays, non-label endpoints, and third-party questionnaires when a contract forbids disclosure. Not-CCI: route, frequency, and setting; design; results; CRO names; and fact of HA consult. Other: may-be-CCI includes exposure calculations, exposure and sales by country, projected exposure, product cost, and net pricing. Not-CCI: list pricing.",
        "voiceRef": "voice_ast_narrator",
        "locale": "en"
      }
    },
