      "voiceover": {
        "captionText": "Now, once you have classified, where does it go? FORM-AST-35734 \u2014 the CCI library. Think of it as your asset's living record. The cover captures your version date, the asset code or INN \u2014 that is the ASPXXXX identifier \u2014 the Project ID in Helix, and the development phase. Inside, the library is organized by columns: type, subtype, CCI exact text, and notes. And one practical rule: one tab per phase. That is how each phase gets its own clean workspace in the FORM.",
