      "voiceover": {
        "captionText": "Here is the path when a compound moves from CN to IND. The PD Lead initiates. Then the Asset Lead classifies with the GUIDE \u2014 and may consult an SME, a Dept Head, or Legal. Next: document on the FORM. Then inform the PD Lead. Archive. And finally, inform the Disclosing Parties. That is the path \u2014 from initiation to notification.",
